# Signing keys never belong in the repository: they live in the GitHub secrets and in the owner's own offline backup
# (GitHub's push protection does not recognise key files, so they are blocked here by name)
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
dev-key-secrets.txt
